{"schema_version":1,"guid":"http://audio.xmcdn.com/group24/M02/B3/8E/wKgJNVhNZd3A-cjbAC0HgKI6z5c349.m4a","apple_collection_id":"1091474627","show":"双语早餐【英语漫游 英语口语听力每天学 Learning English】","titel":"想要帅气优雅地为男／女神安排好一切，果断用fix嘛～","audio":{"url":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//wKgJNVhNZd3A-cjbAC0HgKI6z5c349.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=3834696&track_id=26750242&uid=8914100&jt=http://audio.xmcdn.com/group24/M02/B3/8E/wKgJNVhNZd3A-cjbAC0HgKI6z5c349.m4a","user_agent":"PodcastsAM/1.0 (+https://amapps.app)","groesse":2951040,"format":"m4a","geprueft_am":"2026-08-27T21:51:23+00:00"},"faehigkeiten":{"clips":false,"range":true,"kapitel":true,"dynamik":"unbestimmt","grund":"M4A: Ausschnitte nur als AAC-Bloecke (clips_aac) - eine App ohne ADTS-Umverpackung zeigt keine","clips_aac":true},"einzeiler":"详解英文单词 fix 的多种实用含义与口语表达","kurzfassung":"本期节目详细解析了英文单词 fix 的多种用法，涵盖处理问题、巧妙安排、暗箱操作以及口语中的惩罚含义。此外，节目还介绍了 in a fix、quick fix 以及 if it ain't broke, don't fix it 等常见习语。最后，主播对本期学习的实用表达进行了全面总结。","stichpunkte":["fix 可表示处理问题，即 fix the problem。","fix 能够表示为某人安排事情，例如 fix for somebody to do something。","fix 在特定语境下可指用不正当手段操纵某事。","口语中 fix 带有惩罚或修理某人的含义。","in a fix 或 put somebody in a fix 用于表达陷入困境或给某人制造麻烦。","quick fix 指权宜之计，例如治理污染没有快速见效的办法。","俗语 if it ain't broke, don't fix it 意为没坏就不要去修它，避免画蛇添足。","主播在节目尾声对所有提到的实用表达进行了系统总结。"],"kapitel":[{"titel":"单词 fix 的基本含义与安排用法","start":26.66},{"titel":"fix 表示操纵与口语中的惩罚","start":73.02},{"titel":"表达麻烦与困境的相关短语","start":114.24},{"titel":"权宜之计与经典俗语","start":175.08},{"titel":"核心实用表达总结与结语","start":233.42}],"clips":[{"hook":"单词fix在口语中还能表示惩罚","start":100.078,"ende":120.233,"laenge":20.15,"byte_start":836366,"byte_ende":997542,"bytes":161177,"range_header":"bytes=836366-997542","vorlauf_s":0.0929,"inhalt_start":100.171,"anker_sha256":"f018f82b8712f11d5dc4a6e6acf13c04fdb35a70e7554a57cfa9165ca6a270d9","anker_ende_sha256":"816dfcdbc0a2800633ef3be87830ab77029e18a96dbb71208c909714ce17b9e0","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"主持人举例说明，当有人做出对不起自己的行为时，可以用特定表达来表示要狠狠惩罚对方。","aac":{"profil":2,"samplerate_index"